  "description": "Wi-Jeong left his hometown in agony after falling in love with his older brother’s fiancée, a secret he could never confess. Seven years later, he returns to Seorabeol and unexpectedly reunites with Jin-Hui, a boy he once knew but had long forgotten. As memories resurface, so does a promise from the past that Jin-Hui has never let go of.\n\n *\"You said you would reward me if I waited patiently.\"\n\n\"Wi-Jeong, now...let’s become a real couple.\"*\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
